ALL.append(q(393,"Medium",'"I would prefer to discuss this matter in private," the senator said to the reporter.',["The senator told the reporter that he would prefer to discuss that matter in private.","The senator told the reporter that he will prefer to discuss that matter in private.","The senator told the reporter that I would prefer to discuss this matter in private.","The senator told the reporter that he would preferred to discuss that matter in private."],"The senator told the reporter that he would prefer to discuss that matter in private.","'Would prefer' stays; 'I' → 'he'; 'this' → 'that.'",["no tense change","modal verb","place expression"]))
ALL.append(q(394,"Medium",'"I used to believe that hard work alone guarantees success, but now I know better," she reflected.',["She reflected that she had used to believe that hard work alone guaranteed success but that then she knew better.","She reflected that she used to believe that hard work alone guaranteed success but that she knew better.","She reflected that she used to believe that hard work alone guarantees success but now she knows better.","She reflected that I used to believe that hard work alone guarantees success but now I know better."],"She reflected that she used to believe that hard work alone guaranteed success but that she knew better.","'Used to believe' stays; 'guarantees' → 'guaranteed'; 'know' → 'knew'; 'I' → 'she'; 'now' → 'then' (implied).",["tense backshift","habitual action","pronoun change"]))
